[2006.602729, "o", "       -print True; print the full file name on the standard output, followed by a newline.  If you are piping the output of \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22minto another\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 583 (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K              program and there is the faintest possibility that the files which you are searching for  might  contain  a  newline,  then  you\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 584 (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K              should  seriously  consider using the \u001b[1m-print0 \u001b[22moption instead of \u001b[1m-print\u001b[22m.  See the \u001b[1mUNUSUAL FILENAMES \u001b[22msection for information about\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 585 (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K              how unusual characters in filenames are handled.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 586 (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 587 (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       -print0\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 588 (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
