[2007.271048, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM       -D                     4.3.1\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1197/1271 97% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -newerXY               4.3.3      BSD\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1196/1271 97% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -files0-from           4.9.0\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1195/1271 97% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       Feature                Added in   Also occurs in\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1194/1271 97% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2007.271344, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       diately.  Previously, \u001b[1mfind\u001b[22m's exit status was unaffected by the failure of \u001b[1m-delete\u001b[22m.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1193/1271 97% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       As of findutils-4.3.11, the \u001b[1m-delete \u001b[22maction sets \u001b[1mfind\u001b[22m's exit status to a nonzero value when it fails.  However, \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22mwill not exit imme‐\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1192/1271 97% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1191/1271 97% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2007.287255, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       Nanosecond-resolution timestamps were implemented in findutils-4.3.3.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1190/1271 97% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1189/1271 97% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2007.2877, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM       As of findutils-4.3.3, \u001b[1m-perm /000 \u001b[22mnow matches all files instead of none.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1188/1271 97% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1187/1271 97% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2007.303609, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       POSIX interpretation 126 requires this.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1186/1271 97% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       As  of findutils-4.2.2, shell metacharacters (`*', `?' or `[]' for example) used in filename patterns match a leading `.', because IEEE\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1185/1271 97% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2007.303793, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[1mCOMPATIBILITY\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1184/1271 97% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1183/1271 97% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2007.303894, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM       \u001b[1m-print0 \u001b[22mand \u001b[1mxargs -0 \u001b[22mcame from Dan Bernstein.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1182/1271 96% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2007.304343, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM       GNU \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22mwas originally written by Eric Decker, with enhancements by David MacKenzie, Jay Plett, and  Tim  Wood.   The  idea  for  \u001b[1mfind\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1181/1271 96% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2007.304598, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1180/1271 96% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2007.320664, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       on-line at <https://www.cs.dartmouth.edu/~doug/reader.pdf>.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1179/1271 96% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2007.32087, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM       \u001b[4mA\u001b[24m  \u001b[4mResearch\u001b[24m  \u001b[4mUNIX\u001b[24m  \u001b[4mReader:\u001b[24m \u001b[4mAnnotated\u001b[24m \u001b[4mExcerpts\u001b[24m \u001b[4mfrom\u001b[24m \u001b[4mthe\u001b[24m \u001b[4mProgrammer’s\u001b[24m \u001b[4mManual,\u001b[24m \u001b[4m1971-1986\u001b[24m provides some additional details; you can read it\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1178/1271 96% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       A \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22mprogram appeared in Version 5 Unix as part of the Programmer's Workbench project and was written by Dick Haight.  Doug McIlroy's\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1177/1271 96% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[1mHISTORY\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1176/1271 96% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2007.320967, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2007.321468, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1175/1271 96% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       not have been examined or some pending program invocations for \u001b[1m-exec ... {} + \u001b[22mor \u001b[1m-execdir ... {} + \u001b[22mmay not have been performed.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1174/1271 96% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       When some error occurs, \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22mmay stop immediately, without completing all the actions specified.  For example, some starting points may\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1173/1271 96% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1172/1271 96% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       description, but if the return value is non-zero, you should not rely on the correctness of the results of \u001b[1mfind\u001b[22m.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1171/1271 96% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22mexits with status 0 if all files are processed successfully, greater than 0 if errors occur.  This is deliberately  a  very  broad\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1170/1271 96% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2007.321705, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[1mEXIT STATUS\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1169/1271 96% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1168/1271 96% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM                  \u001b[1m[compile/64/tests][find]\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1167/1271 96% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2007.337085, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM                  \u001b[1m[.][compile]\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1166/1271 96% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM                  \u001b[1m[/tmp][TRACE]\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1165/1271 96% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM                  \u001b[1m[][tmp]\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1164/1271 96% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
