[2007.371603, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM              condition between tests binds more tightly than \u001b[1m-o\u001b[22m, this is the default anyway, but the parentheses help to show what  is  going\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1120/1271 93% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              sises  that  the  \u001b[1m-print0 \u001b[22maction takes place only for things that didn't have \u001b[1m-prune \u001b[22mapplied to them.  Because the default `and'\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1119/1271 93% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2007.371982, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM              their contents are irrelevant).  The expression on the right hand side of the \u001b[1m-o \u001b[22mis in parentheses only for clarity.  It  empha‐\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1118/1271 93% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              evaluated  only  for  those directories which didn't get pruned (the contents of the pruned directories are not even visited, so\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1117/1271 92% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2007.3873, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              which are to be pruned.  However, the \u001b[1m-prune \u001b[22maction itself returns true, so the following \u001b[1m-o \u001b[22mensures that the right hand side is\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1116/1271 92% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              The construct \u001b[1m-prune -o \\( ... -print0 \\) \u001b[22mis quite common.  The idea here is that the expression before  \u001b[1m-prune  \u001b[22mmatches  things\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1115/1271 92% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2007.387476, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1114/1271 92% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM                      \u001b[1m| cpio -pmd0 /dest-dir\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1113/1271 92% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM                  \u001b[1m$ find . -name .snapshot -prune -o \\( \\! -name '*~' -print0 \\) \\\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1112/1271 92% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2007.388074, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM                  \u001b[1m$ cd /source-dir\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1111/1271 92% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1110/1271 92% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              omits files or directories whose name ends in `~', but not their contents.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1109/1271 92% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       •      Copy  the  contents of \u001b[4m/source-dir\u001b[24m to \u001b[4m/dest-dir\u001b[24m, but omit files and directories named \u001b[4m.snapshot\u001b[24m (and anything in them).  It also\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1108/1271 92% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2007.402671, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM   \u001b[1mPruning - omitting files and subdirectories\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1107/1271 92% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1106/1271 92% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2007.40277, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM              set (\u001b[1m-perm /222 \u001b[22mor \u001b[1m-perm /a+w\u001b[22m) but are not executable for anybody (\u001b[1m! -perm /111 \u001b[22mor \u001b[1m! -perm /a+x \u001b[22mrespectively).\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1105/1271 92% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              These two commands both search for files that are readable for everybody (\u001b[1m-perm -444 \u001b[22mor \u001b[1m-perm -a+r\u001b[22m), have at least one write bit\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1104/1271 92% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2007.403018, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1103/1271 92% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM                  \u001b[1m$ find . -perm -a+r -perm /a+w \\! -perm /a+x\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1102/1271 92% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM                  \u001b[1m$ find . -perm -444 -perm /222 \\! -perm /111\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1101/1271 92% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1100/1271 91% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       •      A more elaborate search on permissions.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1099/1271 91% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2007.420944, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1098/1271 91% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              Both these commands do the same thing.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1097/1271 91% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1096/1271 91% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2007.421112, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM                  \u001b[1m$ find . -perm -g+w,u+w\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1095/1271 91% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM                  \u001b[1m$ find . -perm -220\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1094/1271 91% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1093/1271 91% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2007.421211, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM       •      Search for files which are writable by both their owner and their group.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1092/1271 91% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1091/1271 91% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2007.421762, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM              two use the symbolic form.  The files don't have to be writable by both the owner and group to be matched; either will do.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1090/1271 91% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              All three of these commands do the same thing, but the first one uses the octal representation of the file mode, and  the  other\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1089/1271 91% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1088/1271 91% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM                  \u001b[1m$ find . -perm /u=w,g=w\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1087/1271 91% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM                  \u001b[1m$ find . -perm /u+w,g+w\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1086/1271 91% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2007.453957, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM                  \u001b[1m$ find . -perm /220\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1085/1271 91% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1084/1271 91% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       •      Search for files which are writable by either their owner or their group.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1083/1271 91% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
