[2013.640056, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM                            compatibility with that format, there is no fractional part in the seconds field.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 712/1271 62% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM                     c      locale's date and time (Sat Nov 04 12:02:33 EST 1989).  The format is the same as for \u001b[1mctime\u001b[22m(3) and so to  preserve\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 711/1271 62% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 710/1271 62% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM                     B      locale's full month name, variable length (January..December)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 709/1271 62% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 708/1271 61% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM                     b      locale's abbreviated month name (Jan..Dec)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 707/1271 61% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 706/1271 61% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM                     A      locale's full weekday name, var