[2013.654777, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM                     +      Date and time, separated by `+', for example `2004-04-28+22:22:05.0'.  This is a GNU extension.  The time is given\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 693/1271 60% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
