[2013.671065, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM              A `\\' character followed by any other character is treated as an ordinary character, so they both are printed.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 660/1271 59% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
