[2013.720806, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM              aligned).  Unlike \u001b[1m-print\u001b[22m, \u001b[1m-printf \u001b[22mdoes not add a newline at the end of the string.  The escapes and directives are:\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 636/1271 58% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2013.720889, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM              mean that flags don't work as you might expect.  This also means that the `-' flag does work  (it  forces  fields  to  be  left-\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 635/1271 58% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              specified  as with the \u001b[1mprintf\u001b[22m(3) C function.  Please note that many of the fields are printed as %s rather than %d, and this may\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 634/1271 58% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              True; print \u001b[4mformat\u001b[24m on the standard output, interpreting `\\' escapes and `%' directives.  Field  widths  and  precisions  can  be\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 633/1271 58% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -printf \u001b[4mformat\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 632/1271 58% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 631/1271 58% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2013.720982, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              grams that process the \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22moutput.  This option corresponds to the \u001b[1m-0 \u001b[22moption of \u001b[1mxargs\u001b[22m.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 630/1271 58% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2013.721419, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              \u001b[1m-print  \u001b[22muses).   This  allows file names that contain newlines or other types of white space to be correctly interpreted by pro‐\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 629/1271 58% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
