[2013.737892, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM              program and there is the faintest possibility that the files which you are searching for  might  contain  a  newline,  then  you\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 623/1271 57% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -print True; print the full file name on the standard output, followed by a newline.  If you are piping the output of \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22minto another\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 622/1271 57% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 621/1271 57% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              tion.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 620/1271 57% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2013.738327, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM              is  run,  its  standard input is redirected from \u001b[4m/dev/null\u001b[24m.  This action may not be specified together with the \u001b[1m-files0-from \u001b[22mop‐\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 619/1271 57% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
