[2013.753878, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM              classes) and \u001b[1mLC_COLLATE \u001b[22m(character ranges and equivalence classes).\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 615/1271 57% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              case, the interpretation of the regular expression itself will be affected by  the  environment  variables  \u001b[1mLC_CTYPE  \u001b[22m(character\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 614/1271 57% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2013.7543, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              from  \u001b[1mfind\u001b[22m's  message  translations.   If  the system has no suitable definition, \u001b[1mfind\u001b[22m's own definition will be used.  In either\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 613/1271 57% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              sponse.  This regular expression is obtained from the system if the \u001b[1mPOSIXLY_CORRECT \u001b[22menvironment variable is  set,  or  otherwise\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 612/1271 57% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              The response to the prompt is matched against a pair of regular expressions to determine if it is an affirmative or negative re‐\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 611/1271 57% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 610/1271 57% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
