[2013.804409, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              variable \u001b[1mPOSIXLY_CORRECT \u001b[22mis set, in which case 512-byte blocks are used.  See the  \u001b[1mUNUSUAL  FILENAMES  \u001b[22msection  for  information\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 604/1271 57% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -ls    True;  list  current  file  in  \u001b[1mls -dils \u001b[22mformat on standard output.  The block counts are of 1 KB blocks, unless the environment\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 603/1271 57% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
