[2025.959288, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM              filesystem types that are accepted on some version of Unix or another is: ufs, 4.2, 4.3, nfs, tmp, mfs, S51K, S52K.  You can use\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 327/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2025.987129, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              File is on a filesystem of type \u001b[4mtype\u001b[24m.  The valid filesystem types vary among different versions of Unix; an incomplete  list  of\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 326/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -fstype \u001b[4mtype\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 325/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2025.987174, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 324/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2025.987376, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -false Always false.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 323/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2026.024384, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 322/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              ceeds can actually be executed.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 321/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2027.351842, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              this  test  is based only on the result of the \u001b[1maccess\u001b[22m(2) system call, there is no guarantee that a file for which this test suc‐\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 320/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              implement \u001b[1maccess\u001b[22m(2) in the client's kernel and so cannot make use of the UID mapping information held on  the  server.   Because\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 319/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2027.351966, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM              of  the  \u001b[1maccess\u001b[22m(2) system call, and so can be fooled by NFS servers which do UID mapping (or root-squashing), since many systems\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 318/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2027.386954, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              This takes into account access control lists and other permissions artefacts which the \u001b[1m-perm \u001b[22mtest ignores.  This test makes  use\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 317/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              Matches  files  which are executable and directories which are searchable (in a file name resolution sense) by the current user.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 316/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2027.407067, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -executable\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 315/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 314/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2027.436828, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -empty File is empty and is either a regular file or a directory.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 313/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 312/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2027.454574, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              rounding affects the interpretation of file status change times.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 311/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2027.454685, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM              File's status was last changed less than, more than or exactly \u001b[4mn\u001b[24m*24 hours ago.  See the comments for \u001b[1m-atime  \u001b[22mto  understand  how\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 310/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2027.567853, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -ctime \u001b[4mn\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 309/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 308/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              the file it points to is always used.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 307/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2027.753117, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              If  \u001b[4mreference\u001b[24m is a symbolic link and the \u001b[1m-H \u001b[22moption or the \u001b[1m-L \u001b[22moption is in effect, then the time of the last data modification of\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 306/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              Time of the last status change of the current file is more recent than that of the last data modification of the \u001b[4mreference\u001b[24m file.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 305/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2027.919692, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -cnewer \u001b[4mreference\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 304/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 303/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2028.142425, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              File's status was last changed less than, more than or exactly \u001b[4mn\u001b[24m minutes ago.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 302/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -cmin \u001b[4mn\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 301/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2028.242407, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 300/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              days ago.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 299/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2028.299854, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              file was last accessed, any fractional part is ignored, so to match \u001b[1m-atime +1\u001b[22m, a file has to have been  accessed  at  least  \u001b[4mtwo\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 298/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              File  was  last accessed less than, more than or exactly \u001b[4mn\u001b[24m*24 hours ago.  When \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22mfigures out how many 24-hour periods ago the\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 297/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
