[2048.371681, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM              this  test  is based only on the result of the \u001b[1maccess\u001b[22m(2) system call, there is no guarantee that a file for which this test suc‐\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 320/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2048.371933, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM              implement \u001b[1maccess\u001b[22m(2) in the client's kernel and so cannot make use of the UID mapping information held on  the  server.   Because\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 319/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2048.388066, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              of  the  \u001b[1maccess\u001b[22m(2) system call, and so can be fooled by NFS servers which do UID mapping (or root-squashing), since many systems\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 318/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2048.388157, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2048.388636, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM              This takes into account access control lists and other permissions artefacts which the \u001b[1m-perm \u001b[22mtest ignores.  This test makes  use\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 317/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              Matches  files  which are executable and directories which are searchable (in a file name resolution sense) by the current user.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 316/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -executable\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 315/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 314/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2048.42079, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -empty File is empty and is either a regular file or a directory.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 313/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2048.420893, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 312/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              rounding affects the interpretation of file status change times.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 311/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2048.421217, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM              File's status was last changed less than, more than or exactly \u001b[4mn\u001b[24m*24 hours ago.  See the comments for \u001b[1m-atime  \u001b[22mto  understand  how\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 310/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2048.437044, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -ctime \u001b[4mn\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 309/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 308/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2048.443896, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              the file it points to is always used.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 307/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2048.443955, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM              If  \u001b[4mreference\u001b[24m is a symbolic link and the \u001b[1m-H \u001b[22moption or the \u001b[1m-L \u001b[22moption is in effect, then the time of the last data modification of\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 306/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              Time of the last status change of the current file is more recent than that of the last data modification of the \u001b[4mreference\u001b[24m file.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 305/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2048.487057, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -cnewer \u001b[4mreference\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 304/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 303/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              File's status was last changed less than, more than or exactly \u001b[4mn\u001b[24m minutes ago.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 302/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -cmin \u001b[4mn\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 301/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2048.514714, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 300/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              days ago.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 299/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2048.5314, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              file was last accessed, any fractional part is ignored, so to match \u001b[1m-atime +1\u001b[22m, a file has to have been  accessed  at  least  \u001b[4mtwo\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 298/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
