[2055.999553, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              File's status was last changed less than, more than or exactly \u001b[4mn\u001b[24m*24 hours ago.  See the comments for \u001b[1m-atime  \u001b[22mto  understand  how\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 310/1271 31% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
