[2065.922049, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM       ence  file  cannot  be  examined (for example, the \u001b[1mstat\u001b[22m(2) system call fails for it), an error message is issued, and \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22mexits with a\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 275/1271 29% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2065.937636, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       and \u001b[1m-P \u001b[22mand any previous \u001b[1m-follow\u001b[22m, but the reference file is only examined once, at the time the command line is parsed.  If  the  refer‐\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 274/1271 29% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2065.937809, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM       specified on the command line.  When these tests are used, the interpretation of the reference file is determined by the options \u001b[1m-H\u001b[22m, \u001b[1m-L\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 273/1271 29% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       Some  tests,  for  example  \u001b[1m-newerXY  \u001b[22mand \u001b[1m-samefile\u001b[22m, allow comparison between the file currently being examined and some reference file\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 272/1271 29% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM   \u001b[1mTESTS\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 271/1271 29% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n"]
[2065.938236, "o", "\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 270/1271 29% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -xdev  Don't descend directories on other filesystems.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 269/1271 29% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2065.938589, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 268/1271 29% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              Print the \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22mversion number and exit.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 267/1271 29% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -version, --version\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 266/1271 28% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2065.953509, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 265/1271 28% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              to stat them; this gives a significant increase in search speed.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 264/1271 28% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              tory are non-directories (`leaf' files in the directory tree).  If only the files' names need to be examined, there is  no  need\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 263/1271 28% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              ter  it  has statted 2 fewer subdirectories than the directory's link count, it knows that the rest of the entries in the direc‐\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 262/1271 28% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2065.986972, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              tionally, its subdirectories (if any) each have a `..' entry linked to that directory.  When \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22mis examining a directory,  af‐\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 261/1271 28% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              volume  mount  points.  Each directory on a normal Unix filesystem has at least 2 hard links: its name and its `.' entry.  Addi‐\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 260/1271 28% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2065.987134, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM              when searching filesystems that do not follow the Unix directory-link convention, such as CD-ROM or MS-DOS  filesystems  or  AFS\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 259/1271 28% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              Do  not  optimize by assuming that directories contain 2 fewer subdirectories than their hard link count.  This option is needed\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 258/1271 28% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -noleaf\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 257/1271 28% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2066.011121, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 256/1271 28% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              Turns off the effect of \u001b[1m-ignore_readdir_race\u001b[22m.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 255/1271 28% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -noignore_readdir_race\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 254/1271 28% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 253/1271 27% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2066.053202, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              \u001b[1mfind\u001b[22m.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 252/1271 27% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -mount Don't descend directories on other filesystems.  An alternate name for \u001b[1m-xdev\u001b[22m, for compatibility  with  some  other  versions  of\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 251/1271 27% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2066.053903, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 250/1271 27% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              files except the starting-points.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 249/1271 27% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              Do  not  apply  any  tests  or actions at levels less than \u001b[4mlevels\u001b[24m (a non-negative integer).  Using \u001b[1m-mindepth 1 \u001b[22mmeans process all\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 248/1271 27% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2066.08667, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -mindepth \u001b[4mlevels\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 247/1271 27% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 246/1271 27% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2066.124567, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              apply the tests and actions to the starting-points themselves.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 245/1271 27% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              Descend at most \u001b[4mlevels\u001b[24m (a non-negative integer) levels of directories below the starting-points.  Using \u001b[1m-maxdepth 0  \u001b[22mmeans  only\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 244/1271 27% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2066.505967, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -maxdepth \u001b[4mlevels\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 243/1271 27% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 242/1271 27% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2066.537098, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              will be true.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 241/1271 27% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2066.537273, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM              peared  since  the  parent directory was read: it will not output an error diagnostic, and the return code of the \u001b[1m-delete \u001b[22maction\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 240/1271 27% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2066.579129, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              Furthermore, \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22mwith the \u001b[1m-ignore_readdir_race \u001b[22moption will ignore errors of the \u001b[1m-delete \u001b[22maction in the case the file has  disap‐\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 239/1271 27% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2066.579251, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 238/1271 27% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              without it).\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 237/1271 27% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2066.628614, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              with  this  option  off  (if  you need to do that, you will need to issue two \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22mcommands instead, one with the option and one\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 236/1271 27% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              time the command line is read, which means that you cannot search one part of the filesystem with this option on and part of  it\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 235/1271 26% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K"]
[2066.628755, "o", "\u001b[H\u001bM              sued.   This  also  applies  to files or directories whose names are given on the command line.  This option takes effect at the\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 234/1271 26% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              the time \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22mreads the name of the file from the directory and the time it tries to stat the file, no error message will be is‐\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 233/1271 26% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2066.686434, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM              Normally, \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22mwill emit an error message when it fails to stat a file.  If you give this option and a file is  deleted  between\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 232/1271 26% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KA\bA\r\u001b[K\u001b[H\u001bM       -ignore_readdir_race\u001b[m\r\n"]
[2066.686602, "o", "\u001b[41;1H\r\u001b[K\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 231/1271 26% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
