[2067.742556, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 231/1271 26% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K   \u001b[1mTESTS\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 232/1271 26% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       Some  tests,  for  example  \u001b[1m-newerXY  \u001b[22mand \u001b[1m-samefile\u001b[22m, allow comparison between the file currently being examined and some reference file\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 233/1271 26% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       specified on the command line.  When these tests are used, the interpretation of the reference file is determined by the options \u001b[1m-H\u001b[22m, \u001b[1m-L\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 234/1271 26% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2067.777559, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       and \u001b[1m-P \u001b[22mand any previous \u001b[1m-follow\u001b[22m, but the reference file is only examined once, at the time the command line is parsed.  If  the  refer‐\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 235/1271 26% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
