[2068.388938, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K              file was last accessed, any fractional part is ignored, so to match \u001b[1m-atime +1\u001b[22m, a file has to have been  accessed  at  least  \u001b[4mtwo\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 259/1271 28% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K              days ago.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 260/1271 28% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
