[2070.686469, "o", "       -mtime \u001b[4mn\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 326/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K              File's data was last modified less than, more than or exactly \u001b[4mn\u001b[24m*24 hours ago.  See the comments for  \u001b[1m-atime  \u001b[22mto  understand  how\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 327/1271 32% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K              rounding affects the interpretation of file modification times.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 328/1271 33% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
