[2070.853149, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K              c   The inode status change time of \u001b[4mreference\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 354/1271 35% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
