[2070.945087, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K              t   \u001b[4mreference\u001b[24m is interpreted directly as a time\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 356/1271 35% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
[2070.945232, "o", "\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 357/1271 35% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2070.951076, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K              Some  combinations are invalid; for example, it is invalid for \u001b[4mX\u001b[24m to be \u001b[4mt\u001b[24m.  Some combinations are not implemented on all systems;\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 358/1271 35% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2070.951144, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K              for example \u001b[4mB\u001b[24m is not supported on all systems.  If an invalid or unsupported combination of \u001b[4mXY\u001b[24m is specified, a fatal  error  re‐\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 359/1271 36% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2071.419786, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
[2071.420232, "o", "              sults.   Time specifications are interpreted as for the argument to the \u001b[1m-d \u001b[22moption of GNU \u001b[1mdate\u001b[22m.  If you try to use the birth time\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 360/1271 36% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
[2071.420414, "o", "              of a reference file, and the birth time cannot be determined, a fatal error message results.  If you specify a test which refers\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 361/1271 36% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2071.454049, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K              to the birth time of files being examined, this test will fail for any files where the birth time is unknown.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 362/1271 36% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
[2071.454429, "o", "\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 363/1271 36% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       -nogroup\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 364/1271 36% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K              No group corresponds to file's numeric group ID.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 365/1271 36% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2071.454569, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 366/1271 36% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
