[2071.507814, "o", "              do UID mapping (or root-squashing), since many systems implement \u001b[1maccess\u001b[22m(2) in the client's kernel and so cannot make use of  the\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 480/1271 44% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K              UID mapping information held on the server.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 481/1271 44% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
