[2071.524578, "o", "              its standard input is redirected from \u001b[4m/dev/null\u001b[24m.  This action may not be specified together with the \u001b[1m-files0-from \u001b[22moption.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 570/1271 54% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 571/1271 54% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
[2071.524713, "o", "              The response to the prompt is matched against a pair of regular expressions to determine if it is an affirmative or negative re‐\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 572/1271 54% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K              sponse.  This regular expression is obtained from the system if the \u001b[1mPOSIXLY_CORRECT \u001b[22menvironment variable is  set,  or  otherwise\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 573/1271 54% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
[2071.52478, "o", "              from  \u001b[1mfind\u001b[22m's  message  translations.   If  the system has no suitable definition, \u001b[1mfind\u001b[22m's own definition will be used.  In either\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 574/1271 54% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
