[2071.537878, "o", "              True; print the full file name on the standard output, followed by a null character  (instead  of  the  newline  character  that\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 589/1271 55% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K              \u001b[1m-print  \u001b[22muses).   This  allows file names that contain newlines or other types of white space to be correctly interpreted by pro‐\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 590/1271 56% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K              grams that process the \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22moutput.  This option corresponds to the \u001b[1m-0 \u001b[22moption of \u001b[1mxargs\u001b[22m.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 591/1271 56% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
