[2071.538113, "o", "              True; print \u001b[4mformat\u001b[24m on the standard output, interpreting `\\' escapes and `%' directives.  Field  widths  and  precisions  can  be\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 594/1271 56% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K              specified  as with the \u001b[1mprintf\u001b[22m(3) C function.  Please note that many of the fields are printed as %s rather than %d, and this may\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 595/1271 56% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
