[2071.572636, "o", "                     c      locale's date and time (Sat Nov 04 12:02:33 EST 1989).  The format is the same as for \u001b[1mctime\u001b[22m(3) and so to  preserve\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 672/1271 60% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K                            compatibility with that format, there is no fractional part in the seconds field.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 673/1271 60% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 674/1271 60% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
