[2110.872259, "o", "       •      Search for files in your home directory which have been modified in the last twenty-four hours.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1013/1271 86% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
