[2110.884355, "o", "                  \u001b[1m[.][..]\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1123/1271 93% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K                  \u001b[1m[][/]\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1124/1271 93% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
[2110.884631, "o", "                  \u001b[1m[][tmp]\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1125/1271 93% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K                  \u001b[1m[/tmp][TRACE]\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1126/1271 93% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K                  \u001b[1m[.][compile]\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1127/1271 93% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K                  \u001b[1m[compile/64/tests][find]\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1128/1271 93% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1129/1271 93% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
[2110.884911, "o", "\u001b[1mEXIT STATUS\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1130/1271 93% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22mexits with status 0 if all files are processed successfully, greater than 0 if errors occur.  This is deliberately  a  very  broad\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1131/1271 93% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       description, but if the return value is non-zero, you should not rely on the correctness of the results of \u001b[1mfind\u001b[22m.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1132/1271 93% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
[2110.885137, "o", "\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1133/1271 93% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       When some error occurs, \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22mmay stop immediately, without completing all the actions specified.  For example, some starting points may\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1134/1271 94% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       not have been examined or some pending program invocations for \u001b[1m-exec ... {} + \u001b[22mor \u001b[1m-execdir ... {} + \u001b[22mmay not have been performed.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1135/1271 94% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1136/1271 94% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\u001b[1mHISTORY\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1137/1271 94% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
[2110.885315, "o", "       A \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22mprogram appeared in Version 5 Unix as part of the Programmer's Workbench project and was written by Dick Haight.  Doug McIlroy's\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1138/1271 94% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       \u001b[4mA\u001b[24m  \u001b[4mResearch\u001b[24m  \u001b[4mUNIX\u001b[24m  \u001b[4mReader:\u001b[24m \u001b[4mAnnotated\u001b[24m \u001b[4mExcerpts\u001b[24m \u001b[4mfrom\u001b[24m \u001b[4mthe\u001b[24m \u001b[4mProgrammer’s\u001b[24m \u001b[4mManual,\u001b[24m \u001b[4m1971-1986\u001b[24m provides some additional details; you can read it\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1139/1271 94% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
[2110.885499, "o", "       on-line at <https://www.cs.dartmouth.edu/~doug/reader.pdf>.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1140/1271 94% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1141/1271 94% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
[2110.885683, "o", "       GNU \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22mwas originally written by Eric Decker, with enhancements by David MacKenzie, Jay Plett, and  Tim  Wood.   The  idea  for  \u001b[1mfind\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1142/1271 94% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       \u001b[1m-print0 \u001b[22mand \u001b[1mxargs -0 \u001b[22mcame from Dan Bernstein.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1143/1271 94% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2110.885875, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1144/1271 94% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\u001b[1mCOMPATIBILITY\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1145/1271 94% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
[2110.886215, "o", "       As  of findutils-4.2.2, shell metacharacters (`*', `?' or `[]' for example) used in filename patterns match a leading `.', because IEEE\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1146/1271 95% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       POSIX interpretation 126 requires this.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1147/1271 95% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1148/1271 95% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       As of findutils-4.3.3, \u001b[1m-perm /000 \u001b[22mnow matches all files instead of none.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1149/1271 95% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1150/1271 95% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
[2110.886454, "o", "       Nanosecond-resolution timestamps were implemented in findutils-4.3.3.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1151/1271 95% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1152/1271 95% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       As of findutils-4.3.11, the \u001b[1m-delete \u001b[22maction sets \u001b[1mfind\u001b[22m's exit status to a nonzero value when it fails.  However, \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22mwill not exit imme‐\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1153/1271 95% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
[2110.886644, "o", "       diately.  Previously, \u001b[1mfind\u001b[22m's exit status was unaffected by the failure of \u001b[1m-delete\u001b[22m.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1154/1271 95% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       Feature                Added in   Also occurs in\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1155/1271 95% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       -files0-from           4.9.0\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1156/1271 95% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
