[2110.888356, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       The syntax \u001b[1m-perm +MODE \u001b[22mwas removed in findutils-4.5.12, in favour of \u001b[1m-perm /MODE\u001b[22m.  The \u001b[1m+MODE \u001b[22msyntax had been  deprecated  since  findu‐\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1183/1271 97% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
