[2110.889082, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1196/1271 97% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2110.889152, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       This  happens when the shell could expand the pattern \u001b[4m*.c\u001b[24m to more than one file name existing in the current directory, and passing the\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1197/1271 97% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2110.889973, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       resulting file names in the command line to \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22mlike this:\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1198/1271 98% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       \u001b[1mfind . -name frcode.c locate.c word_io.c -print\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1199/1271 98% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       That command is of course not going to work, because the \u001b[1m-name \u001b[22mpredicate allows exactly only one pattern as argument.  Instead of doing\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1200/1271 98% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       things this way, you should enclose the pattern in quotes or escape the wildcard, thus allowing \u001b[1mfind \u001b[22mto use the pattern with the  wild‐\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1201/1271 98% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       card during the search for file name matching instead of file names expanded by the parent shell:\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1202/1271 98% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       \u001b[1m$ find . -name '*.c' -print\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1203/1271 98% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       \u001b[1m$ find . -name \\*.c -print\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1204/1271 98% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1205/1271 98% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\u001b[1mBUGS\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1206/1271 98% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       There are security problems inherent in the behaviour that the POSIX standard specifies for \u001b[1mfind\u001b[22m, which therefore cannot be fixed.  For\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1207/1271 98% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       example, the \u001b[1m-exec \u001b[22maction is inherently insecure, and \u001b[1m-execdir \u001b[22mshould be used instead.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1208/1271 98% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1209/1271 98% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       The environment variable \u001b[1mLC_COLLATE \u001b[22mhas no effect on the \u001b[1m-ok \u001b[22maction.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1210/1271 99% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1211/1271 99% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K"]
[2110.890113, "o", "\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K\u001b[1mREPORTING BUGS\u001b[0m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1212/1271 99% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       GNU findutils online help: <https://www.gnu.org/software/findutils/#get-help>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1213/1271 99% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K       Report any translation bugs to <https://translationproject.org/team/>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[7m Manual page find(1) line 1214/1271 99% (press h for help or q to quit)\u001b[27m\u001b[K\r\u001b[K \u001b[KESC\b\b\bESC\u001b[KO\bO\u001b[KB\bB\r\u001b[K"]
